## Development

Requires Python {{ python_version }}+, uv and just.

```bash
uv sync
uv run pre-commit install
just check
```

Commit `uv.lock` after the first sync. CI installs with `uv sync --locked`.

`just check` runs linting, formatting checks, type checks and tests. `just format` formats the code. `uv run {{ project_slug }}` runs the starter command.

This is a starter package. Replace the greeting and its smoke tests with the application and tests you need.

## Template updates

With a clean Git working tree, run `uvx copier update --vcs-ref=main --overwrite`. Review the changes before committing. Keep `.copier-answers.yml` so Copier can find the source template.

